# This repo only tracks what we've actually modified for the cheliu (蝦米)
# input method: the cheliu module itself, our own docs, and the three helper
# scripts. Everything else in this PIME installation - cinbase, libchewing,
# opencc, the chewing (新酷音) module, core plumbing (server.py,
# textService.py, backends.json, ...), the bundled Python runtime, compiled
# DLLs, vendored front-end libraries - is untouched, byte-identical to what
# a fresh official 1.3.0-stable install already provides. See README.md for
# the install procedure (official installer + git overlay of this repo).
#
# Implemented as an allowlist (ignore everything, then re-include exactly
# what's tracked) so anything new the official installer adds later is
# excluded by default, without needing to remember to add it here.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/register-pime.bat
!/unregister-pime.bat
!/update-pime.bat
!/python/

/python/*
!/python/input_methods/

/python/input_methods/*
!/python/input_methods/cheliu/

# Python bytecode caches - regenerated automatically, not source
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Claude Code local tool settings - machine/session-specific, not project source
.claude/settings.local.json

# Editor swap files
*.swp
